/*!
    \qmltype AccountsListView
    \inherits ListView
    \ingroup sailfish-accounts
    \inqmlmodule Sailfish.Accounts

    \brief A list of selectable accounts

    The AccountsListView type provides a UI element which allows selection
    of an account for use.
*/

/*!
    \qmlproperty enumeration AccountsListView::filterType

    Enables filtering of the accounts according to
    the value of the property of the account associated with the
    given filter type.

    See \l {AccountModel::filterType} {AccountModel.filterType} for valid values

    \sa filter, {AccountModel::filterType} {AccountModel.filterType}
*/

/*!
    \qmlproperty string AccountsListView::filter

    If the filter value is set, the model will only
    present those accounts whose property associated
    with the \c filterType matches the given filter
    value.

    For example, if \c filterType is set to
    \c{AccountModel.ProviderFilter} and \c filter is
    set to \c{"facebook"} then only accounts provided
    by the \c{"facebook"} provider will be presented
    in the model.

    \sa filterType, AccountModel::filter
*/

/*!
    \qmlsignal AccountsListView::accountClicked(int accountId, string providerName)

    This signal is emitted by the list view when the user
    clicks an account.  The \a accountId is the id of the
    account clicked by the user, and the \a providerName
    is the name of the provider which provides that account.
*/